  "doc.title": "Why Can't a Battery Just Hold More? · An Interactive Essay",
  "doc.desc": "From half-reactions, Faraday's constant, and the Nernst equation up to cell specific energy, fast charging, thermal runaway, ageing, cost, and the 2026 frontier: every step with a live model you can push.",
  "nav.back": "← Index",
